OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to ditch town's
OL,4,A'erroneous' hyphens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town which has had its name spelt
OL,7,Fwrong for more than a century is
OL,8,Ffinally getting a correction thanks to
OL,9,FGoogle agreeing to remove "erroneous"
OL,10,Fhyphens.
OL,12,FDubbed the "great dash debate", people
OL,13,Fin Bradford on Avon, Wiltshire, say
OL,14,Finaccurate dashes started to appear
OL,15,Fafter Great Western Railway (GWR) added
OL,16,Fthe punctuation to the Wiltshire town's
OL,17,Frailway sign in 1899.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
